00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:12.500
Hello Kaede.

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:14.410
Welcome Shinobu.

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:17.210
Boy, oh boy...

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:19.240
