me with sweet nectar!

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:49.300
S-Shinobu pouch?

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:50.810
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:52.870
Shinobu
pouch
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:55.980
You were kicked out of the Valley of the Ninja?

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:57.780
