00:15:58.090 --> 00:16:02.460
Well, probably because I blow the
breaker a lot using the microwave...

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:06.950
...while Head Master is recording
his favorite show... I think?

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:08.320
For something like that?!

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.830
How terrible! Shinobu, you should be furious!

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:12.120
But...

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:16.270
Well, I've made Onsokumaru wear the
same underwear for three days...

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:18.500
...because I forgot to wash them.

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:21.580
I broke Sasuke's figurines when I was cleaning...

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.410
I'm sure there's more...

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:26.710
I guess I can somewhat see why now...

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:28.980
I know!

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:32.680
If you don't have a place to go,
come live with me!

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.420
B-But that'd be troublesome for you!

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:39.990
Don't worry. I'll convince my parents.

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:41.660
Mom, it's okay right?

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:42.350
Sure!

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:43.260
That was fast!

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:47.730
Actually, I was listening to your conversation.

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:51.840
You're such a good girl,
I'd be happy to let you stay.

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:55.670
Plus, I've always wanted a daughter.

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:57.830
Thank you very much.

00:16:57.980 --> 00:17:00.380
