00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:21.590
Me too!

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:36.740
Ow!

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:38.150
Shinobu!

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:41.150
Shinobu, here let me see...

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:42.490
Y-Yes...

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:45.990
You're okay. It's a little cut.

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:47.760
I'll lick it for you.

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:56.130
Kaede's mother is so wonderful!

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:59.330
The two-generation, mother-daughter
team wins the golden glove award!

00:17:59.610 --> 00:18:01.170
You make no sense...

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:06.340
I'm home.

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:08.740
Oh, It's a feast tonight!

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:11.880
I know! Shinobu helped make dinner.

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:13.420
Me too! Me too!

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:15.750
I can't wait to eat it.

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:21.760
Shinobu, you should just join our family.

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:25.000
Besides, I've always wanted a daughter.

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:27.030
Thank you so much.

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:29.630
You already have a daughter, remember?!

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.500
I don't deserve such an offer.

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:35.540
That means Kaede and I will have family ties.

